Z||000013||danny boy||02-18-2001||01:19 AM|||| OK, here's the real story. My wife(to be) has a non turbo '93 Eclipse automatic. My GT is faster. I have a twinturbo Stealth. I have beaten every CORVETTE I have ever raced.<BR>0-60 I'm faster than a Viper. I run 12's. Now, heres where it gets interesting.<BR>My Friend has a '91 Eclipse turbo 5sp. his car runs sub 11 second qtr miles. his 2.0 litre single turbo Eclipse will outrun my 3.0 litre twinturbo Stealth. <BR> Mitsubishi Eclipse, Eagle Talon,Plymouth Lasers are all the exact same car. The Gen.1 cars were acually faster than the Gen2 cars. they had 210HP stock. And for less than five bucks you can get them to run 14 second 1320's. Another guy I know runs 12.80's Don't underestimate them.<BR>||||reg||1
